[
  {
    "number": 1,
    "text": "# 妖板交易系统 yaoban-system"
  },
  {
    "number": 2,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 3,
    "text": "把「妖板选手方法论拆解」从书面手册（v4.0）落地为**可运行、可验证、可自迭代**的量化研究系统。"
  },
  {
    "number": 4,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 5,
    "text": "> ⚠️ 本项目仅用于个人方法论研究，不构成投资建议。所有信号须经独立验证与人工确认，交易决策始终由人执行。"
  },
  {
    "number": 6,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 7,
    "text": "## 系统定位"
  },
  {
    "number": 8,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 9,
    "text": "- **知识层**：`../妖板选手方法论拆解/` 下的 v4.0 手册、OCR 语料、素材提取（本项目参数的唯一来源）"
  },
  {
    "number": 10,
    "text": "- **数据层**：akshare → SQLite 本地库（指数日线 / 个股日线 / 涨停池 / 市场活跃度）"
  },
  {
    "number": 11,
    "text": "- **研究层**：回测引擎 → 参数优化 → walk-forward 稳健性验证"
  },
  {
    "number": 12,
    "text": "- **运行层**：每日盘后信号管线（环境打分 → 候选池 → 信号报告）+ 交易日志与执行合规检查"
  },
  {
    "number": 13,
    "text": "- **迭代层**：周绩效 → 月参数网格 → 季方法论迭代，规则版本化上线"
  },
  {
    "number": 14,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 15,
    "text": "## 目录结构"
  },
  {
    "number": 16,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 17,
    "text": "```"
  },
  {
    "number": 18,
    "text": "yaoban-system/"
  },
  {
    "number": 19,
    "text": "├── config/parameters.toml   # 全部规则参数（带置信度标注），单一事实源"
  },
  {
    "number": 20,
    "text": "├── docs/ROADMAP.md          # 落地路线图（P0~P6 + 里程碑）"
  },
  {
    "number": 21,
    "text": "├── src/"
  },
  {
    "number": 22,
    "text": "│   ├── config.py            # TOML 配置加载（标准库 tomllib，零依赖）"
  },
  {
    "number": 23,
    "text": "│   ├── data/                # store.py: SQLite 存储；fetchers.py: akshare 采集（重试/退避）"
  },
  {
    "number": 24,
    "text": "│   ├── core/                # env_score.py: 环境打分；indicators.py: 指标；strategies.py: 五大战法（P2）"
  },
  {
    "number": 25,
    "text": "│   └── report/              # Markdown/HTML 报告生成"
  },
  {
    "number": 26,
    "text": "├── scripts/"
  },
  {
    "number": 27,
    "text": "│   ├── backfill_data.py     # P1: 历史数据回填"
  },
  {
    "number": 28,
    "text": "│   ├── daily_pipeline.py    # P4: 每日盘后管线（骨架）"
  },
  {
    "number": 29,
    "text": "│   └── verify_env.py        # 环境自检"
  },
  {
    "number": 30,
    "text": "├── tests/"
  },
  {
    "number": 31,
    "text": "│   ├── cases.json           # 视频案例库（已知结果，回测回归测试集）"
  },
  {
    "number": 32,
    "text": "│   └── test_smoke.py        # 冒烟测试"
  },
  {
    "number": 33,
    "text": "└── data/yaoban.db           # SQLite（不入库）"
  },
  {
    "number": 34,
    "text": "```"
  },
  {
    "number": 35,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 36,
    "text": "## 快速开始"
  },
  {
    "number": 37,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 38,
    "text": "```powershell"
  },
  {
    "number": 39,
    "text": "# 1. 环境自检（不需要 akshare 的部分）"
  },
  {
    "number": 40,
    "text": "python scripts/verify_env.py"
  },
  {
    "number": 41,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 42,
    "text": "# 2. 回填数据（需要完整权限读取 py_libs 中的 akshare）"
  },
  {
    "number": 43,
    "text": "$env:PYTHONPATH = \"..\\py_libs\""
  },
  {
    "number": 44,
    "text": "python scripts/backfill_data.py --indexes --stocks --limit-pool 5"
  },
  {
    "number": 45,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 46,
    "text": "# 3. 跑冒烟测试"
  },
  {
    "number": 47,
    "text": "python -m unittest discover -s tests -v"
  },
  {
    "number": 48,
    "text": "```"
  },
  {
    "number": 49,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 50,
    "text": "## 自动化调度（P4）"
  },
  {
    "number": 51,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 52,
    "text": "```powershell"
  },
  {
    "number": 53,
    "text": "# 注册每日 15:35 盘后信号任务（生成 scripts\\run_daily.cmd 后注册）"
  },
  {
    "number": 54,
    "text": "powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\\install_schedule.ps1"
  },
  {
    "number": 55,
    "text": "# 任务: YaobanDailySignal（日志: outputs\\signals\\daily.log；报告: outputs\\signals\\YYYY-MM-DD_signal_report.md/.html）"
  },
  {
    "number": 56,
    "text": "# 手动触发: Start-ScheduledTask -TaskName \"YaobanDailySignal\""
  },
  {
    "number": 57,
    "text": "```"
  },
  {
    "number": 58,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 59,
    "text": "> 注：`--update` 会增量拉取全股票池（东财限流下自动回退新浪/腾讯），首次运行约 20-40 分钟；"
  },
  {
    "number": 60,
    "text": "> 任务已设 1 小时执行时限。安装脚本为纯 ASCII（PS 5.1 兼容），runner.cmd 以 GBK 写入（cmd 原生编码）。"
  },
  {
    "number": 61,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 62,
    "text": "## 数据口径"
  },
  {
    "number": 63,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 64,
    "text": "- 指数：`ak.stock_zh_index_daily`（新浪，date/open/high/low/close/volume）"
  },
  {
    "number": 65,
    "text": "- 个股：`ak.stock_zh_a_hist`（东财，前复权；东财接口有频率限制，采集器内置重试与退避）"
  },
  {
    "number": 66,
    "text": "- 涨停池：`ak.stock_zt_pool_em`（东财，仅近期数据，需每日增量积累）"
  },
  {
    "number": 67,
    "text": "- 活跃度：`ak.stock_market_activity_legu`（乐咕，仅当日快照）"
  },
  {
    "number": 68,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 69,
    "text": "## 版本与迭代"
  },
  {
    "number": 70,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 71,
    "text": "- 规则参数变更必须：① 通过 walk-forward 样本外验证 → ② 模拟盘灰度 ≥1 个月 → ③ 合入并 bump 版本（v4.x）"
  },
  {
    "number": 72,
    "text": "- 每次迭代记录见 `docs/iterations/`"
  },
  {
    "number": 73,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 74,
    "text": "## 合规边界"
  },
  {
    "number": 75,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 76,
    "text": "付费\"跟车\"存在合规与资金风险；本项目仅为公开视频内容的方法论研究，不推荐任何标的。"
  }
]

