  {
    "number": 20,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 21,
    "text": "## 2. 每日使用流程"
  },
  {
    "number": 22,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 23,
    "text": "### 2.1 盘后（15:30 后）"
  },
  {
    "number": 24,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 25,
    "text": "```powershell"
  },
  {
    "number": 26,
    "text": "# 任务会自动生成报告；也可以手动跑："
  },
  {
    "number": 27,
    "text": "$env:PYTHONPATH = \"..\\py_libs\"   # 相对 yaoban-system"
  },
  {
    "number": 28,
    "text": "python scripts\\daily_pipeline.py --update"
  },
  {
    "number": 29,
    "text": "```"
  },
  {
    "number": 30,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 31,
    "text": "打开 `outputs/signals/<今日>_signal_report.html`，按顺序做三件事："
  },
  {
    "number": 32,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 33,
    "text": "1. **看市场环境**：环境分（完整五维 0~10）+ 市场状态 + 仓位上限。"
  },
  {
    "number": 34,
    "text": "   - ≥8 强势：可 50-70% 仓位；4-7 中性：30-50%；≤3 弱势：≤20% 或空仓。"
  },
  {
    "number": 35,
    "text": "2. **看已确认买点**（放量阳线）：逐只对照复核清单——"
  },
  {
    "number": 36,
    "text": "   - 板块是否主线（三信号：资金流/核心逻辑/业绩）"
  },
  {
    "number": 37,
    "text": "   - 龙头梯队是否完整（高标/20cm/容量票，盯大成交核心是否掉队）"
  },
  {
    "number": 38,
    "text": "   - 分时确认（次日盘中：放量突破均价线回踩站稳、涨幅≤3%）"
  },
  {
    "number": 39,
    "text": "3. **看观察池**：形态成立但未放量收阳，加入自选次日盯\"放量阳突破回档小高点\"。"
  },
  {
    "number": 40,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 41,
    "text": "### 2.2 记录交易（模拟盘或实盘）"
  },
  {
    "number": 42,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 43,
    "text": "```powershell"
  },
  {
    "number": 44,
    "text": "# 开仓"
  },
  {
    "number": 45,
    "text": "python -m src.journal.journal add_trade --symbol 600584 --name 长电科技 `"
  },
  {
    "number": 46,
    "text": "  --date 2026-08-24 --price 32.5 --shares 2000 --pattern huigui --env 5 `"
  },
  {
    "number": 47,
    "text": "  --stop \"破10日线3天不收回\" --logic \"上升回档+封测主线\""
  },
  {
    "number": 48,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 49,
    "text": "# 卖出"
  },
  {
    "number": 50,
    "text": "python -m src.journal.journal add_exit --trade 1 --date 2026-08-28 --price 35.0 `"
  },
  {
    "number": 51,
    "text": "  --reason profit_take --rule \"赚10-20%先落袋\" --compliant 1"
  },
  {
    "number": 52,
    "text": "```"
  },
  {
    "number": 53,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 54,
    "text": "> 铁律：**买入前写好止损位**；卖出时 `--compliant` 如实标注是否按规则执行（违规=0）。"
