  {
    "number": 111,
    "text": "每月 1 日 10:00 `YaobanMonthlyOptimize` 自动跑 `run_optimize.py`，生成"
  },
  {
    "number": 112,
    "text": "`outputs/iterations/YYYY-MM_proposal.md`："
  },
  {
    "number": 113,
    "text": "- 当前参数 vs 网格候选的验证段净收益对比"
  },
  {
    "number": 114,
    "text": "- 提升 ≥0.15pp 才提案，否则明确\"不提案\"（防参数空转）"
  },
  {
    "number": 115,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 116,
    "text": "### 4.2 手动复核/应用"
  },
  {
    "number": 117,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 118,
    "text": "```powershell"
  },
  {
    "number": 119,
    "text": "python scripts\\run_optimize.py              # 生成提案（只读，不改配置）"
  },
  {
    "number": 120,
    "text": "python scripts\\run_optimize.py --apply      # 应用提案（更新 parameters.toml + bump 版本 + CHANGELOG）"
  },
  {
    "number": 121,
    "text": "```"
  },
  {
    "number": 122,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "number": 123,
    "text": "**护栏**：① walk-forward 评级必须 A/B；② 应用后模拟盘灰度 ≥1 个月；③ 随时可 git 回滚"
  },
  {
    "number": 124,
    "text": "（`git log --oneline config/parameters.toml` 找上一版本）。"
  },
  {
    "number": 125,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
